{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276@rel:R21-11#4b5eb990","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","release":"R21-11","content":"The Os Low Proxy shall create one SwcMod- eSwitchEvent per configured SwCluCOsProxyDispatcherModeSwitchEvent container in the partition specific Service Software Component according [SWS_SwCluC_02272]. The attributes of the SwcModeSwitchEvent shall be set as following: • shortName is set according the container's shortName • startOnEvent is set to the RunnableEntity according [SWS_SwCluC_02273] related to the owning SwCluCOsProxyOsTaskDis- patcher container • activation value is set according the SwCluCOsProxyDispatcherActiva- tion parameter • mode s are created according the SwCluCOsProxyModeInstanceRef (s) where for each different PPortPrototype an RPortPrototype is created at the owing Service Software Component according [SWS_SwCluC_02272] and used as contextPort . • disabledMode (s) are created according the SwCluCOsProxyDisabledMod- eInstanceRef (s) where for each different PPortPrototype an RPortPro- totype is created at the owing Service Software Component according [SWS_SwCluC_02272] and used as contextPort .","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_SoftwareClusterConnection.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:11+00:00","text_key":"6ad1b845da1e"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02276","release":"R25-11","text_